  "description": "Ajin Baek is an actress at the top of her game. She has everything. She’s a beautiful, award-winning actress, the public loves her, and she’s about to announce that she’s getting married. But on the night of the award ceremony, a news program exposes the darkness behind Ajin’s glittery exterior. Just how far was Ajin willing to go to get to where she is now? \n\nThe story consists of a total of four parts, and when the titles of each part are put together, it becomes one sentence, \"Do Not Provoke the Heartless Monster\" \n\n'(Source: WEBTOON)",
